# w.lang.en/shards/catalog-plurals: 50 nouns of the catalog (the head nouns of k.objects and k.animals names that are nouns of k.words) that the morphology rules of w.lang.en do not read both ways, with their plural: "gas" is no plural of "ga", "caves" is the plural of "cave". A reader takes them by lookup before the rules.
